%% AId-UVO-RT runtime control loop (Mermaid source for docs/02-srie-runtime.md)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Probe
    Probe --> Discover: capabilities known
    Discover --> Snapshot: hierarchy + coverage tree
    Snapshot --> Decide
    Decide --> Observe: inner policy picked bias + quantum
    Observe --> Steer: sample values
    Steer --> Run: force / release
    Run --> Snapshot: run quantum, collect events, new coverage
    Snapshot --> Decide: reward + learn
    Snapshot --> [*]: target reached / budget exhausted
